{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19909","headline":"秋怀 四 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋至老更贫，破屋无门扉。\n一片月落床，四壁风入衣。\n疎梦不复远，弱心良易归。\n商葩将去绿，缭绕争余辉。\n野步踏事少，病谋向物违。\n幽幽草根虫，生意与我微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}